description: "Code:\n\nprofile \"moriarty-beta/1\";\nagreement Invoice {\n  intent invoice = { operation: transfer() };\n  action pay uses invoice;\n  const copy = pay;\n}\n"
---
mori::check::action_is_not_a_value

  × `pay` is an action, so it cannot be used as a value.
   ╭─[test.mori:5:16]
 3 │   intent invoice = { operation: transfer() };
 4 │   action pay uses invoice;
   ·          ─┬─
   ·           ╰── declared as an action here
 5 │   const copy = pay;
   ·                ─┬─
   ·                 ╰── used as a value here
 6 │ }
   ╰────
  help: Only declarations can be used in expressions. Refer to the intent the
        action uses instead.
